# Documentation synchronization

Before completing a behavior, schema, route, environment, or test change,
delegate the affected diff to `docs-updater`. Update only verified claims,
frontmatter provenance, indexes, and `docs/log.md`. Skip documentation-only
and formatting-only changes. Never rewrite specification acceptance merely to
match an implementation.
